/* Gp030: PRO/E STEP: seam edge pcurve is degree-1 B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS in .POLYLINE_FORM. with 3 control points forming an L-bend in UV; interior knot multiplicity=2=degree makes it C-1 (true breakpoint); generic ShapeFix_Wire intersection-fix would corrupt this vendor pcurve */
